{
  "lesson": 3,
  "heading": "ஆங்கில மொழிபெயர்ப்பு",
  "lines": [
    "What to do?",
    "How I wish",
    "I could join",
    "my friends here",
    "and sing the praise",
    "of my beloved",
    "as they do",
    "of their men",
    "while pounding paddy together!",
    "I would sing the praise",
    "of his banner",
    "of his crown",
    "of his pearl decked",
    "shoulders",
    "to my hearts content.",
    "Inescapable, I find",
    "my mothers constant watch.",
    "What to do? - M.Bhoopathi"
  ]
}